# LLM development — skill index

Mandatory post-change workflow and merge gates live in the always-on **`llm-development-guidelines.mdc`**. Load skills below when triggers match ([`skills/<name>/SKILL.md`](../../skills/README.md)).

| Symptom / task | Skill |
|----------------|-------|
| Changing `upload`, CLI flags, SBOM, artifact results, Tekton paths that run pulp-tool | **changing-pulp-upload** |
| Changing `Dockerfile`, `.tekton/` container builds, Konflux `pulp-tool-container` image | **changing-pulp-container** |
| User confirms PR materials (body, commit message, CHANGELOG) | **drafting-pulp-tool-pr** |
| Pre-commit, lint, or `make test-diff-coverage` failures; local vs CI mismatch | **troubleshooting-pulp-tool-ci** |

## Lint quick reference

Matches GitHub Actions (`.github/workflows/python-diff-lint.yml`, `security-scan.yml`):

```bash
make lint && make format          # Python only (ruff, pylint, mypy)
make audit                        # pip-audit (dev deps from uv.lock)
pre-commit run --all-files        # commit stage — loop until clean
git fetch origin
pre-commit run --hook-stage pre-push --all-files   # test-diff-coverage + checkton
make pre-commit-ci                # commit + pre-push stages
make test                         # full suite; loop until green
```

| Tool | Config / script |
|------|-----------------|
| Ruff (E/W/F/I/S) | `pyproject.toml` `[tool.ruff]` |
| Pylint (errors only) | `make lint-pylint` → `scripts/run-pylint.sh full`; pre-commit → `run-pylint.sh staged`; `config/pylintrc` |
| Mypy | `pyproject.toml` |
| yamllint | `config/yamllint.yml` |
| hadolint | `scripts/run-hadolint.sh` (DL3041/DL3013 ignored) |
| Checkton | `scripts/run-checkton.sh` |
| codespell | `config/codespell-ignore-words.txt` |

Per-tool targets: `Makefile`, `.pre-commit-config.yaml`.

